      "updated": 1775614110659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Corte S = {s,B,C,E,I}\ncap(S) = c(sA) + c(BD) + c(BF) + c(BH) + c(CF) + c(CH) + c(Et) + c(EH)\n           + c(EJ) + c(It)\n         = 20 + 9 + 14 + 1 + 4 + 20 + 16 + 2 + 7 + 15\n         = 108",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Corte S = {s,B,C,E,I}\ncap(S) = c(sA) + c(BD) + c(BF) + c(BH) + c(CF) + c(CH) + c(Et) + c(EH)\n           + c(EJ) + c(It)\n         = 20 + 9 + 14 + 1 + 4 + 20 + 16 + 2 + 7 + 15\n         = 108",
